<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:style="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:style:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:table="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:table:1.0" xmlns:fo="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:xsl-fo-compatible:1.0" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text" office:version="1.4">
  <office:styles>
    <style:default-style style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-top="0cm" fo:margin-bottom="0cm" fo:line-height="100%"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="10pt"/>
    </style:default-style>
    <style:style style:name="PageStart" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:break-before="page" fo:margin-top="0cm" fo:margin-bottom="0.12in"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Title" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:text-align="center" fo:margin-top="0.08in" fo:margin-bottom="0.12in"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="19pt"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Small" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-top="0cm" fo:margin-bottom="0cm"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="9pt"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Blue" style:family="text">
      <style:text-properties fo:color="#0000ff"/>
    </style:style>
  </office:styles>
  <office:automatic-styles>
    <style:page-layout style:name="PageLayout">
      <style:page-layout-properties fo:page-width="21cm" fo:page-height="29.7cm" fo:margin-top="1.3cm" fo:margin-bottom="1.3cm" fo:margin-left="1.3cm" fo:margin-right="1.3cm"/>
    </style:page-layout>
    <style:style style:name="Table" style:family="table">
      <style:table-properties style:width="18.4cm" table:align="center" table:border-model="collapsing"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Column" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="4.6cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Cell" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="0.5pt solid #777777" fo:padding="0.06in" style:vertical-align="middle"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Label" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="0.5pt solid #777777" fo:padding="0.06in" style:vertical-align="middle" fo:background-color="#eeeeee"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="CenterCell" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="0.5pt solid #777777" fo:padding="0.04in" style:vertical-align="middle"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="LineCell" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border-bottom="0.25pt dotted #999999" fo:padding="0.04in" style:vertical-align="middle"/>
    </style:style>
  </office:automatic-styles>
  <office:master-styles>
    <style:master-page style:name="Default" style:page-layout-name="PageLayout"/>
  </office:master-styles>
  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">「학교장 허가(승인) 교외체험학습」신청서</text:p>
      <table:table table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Column"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Column"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Column"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Column"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CenterCell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>담임</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CenterCell"><text:p>부장</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CenterCell"><text:p>교감</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p>학생 성명</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>학년　 반　 번</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>휴대전화</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>출석인정기간 학기당 10일</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>신청 기간</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>년　 월　 일　~　 월　 일(　 ) 일간</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>우리 학교 학교장 허가 교외체험학습 규정 및 불허기간을 확인하였음</text:p><text:p>시험기간, 성적이의신청기간(3일간), 재시험기간(2일간)에는 불허</text:p><text:p>※ 필요 시 담임교사와의 사전 협의 또는 문의</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Blue">서명 또는 (인)</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>학습 내용</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>○ 현장체험학습(　 )　○ 친·인척 방문(　 )　○ 가족동반여행(　 )　○ 고적답사(　 )</text:p><text:p>○ 향토행사 참여(　 )　○ 기타(　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　)</text:p><text:p>○ 감염병 심각 단계로 인한 가정학습(　 )</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>목적지</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>숙박장소</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>보호자명</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>관계</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>휴대폰</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>인솔자명</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>(　 세)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>관계</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>휴대폰</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>목 적</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>교외 체험 학습 계획</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-rows-spanned="3"><text:p>보호자 외 대리 인솔 시 학생 안전 위임 등에 대한 내용</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CenterCell"><text:p>인솔자</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>이름:</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CenterCell"><text:p>연락처</text:p><text:p>☎ (　　)- (　　)- (　　　　)</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CenterCell"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Blue">인솔 내용</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CenterCell"><text:p>서약</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>○미성년자이므로 보호자 동반 체험학습이 원칙이나, 보호자의 위임을 받아 학생의 안전·건강을 책임지고 대리 인솔합니다. 학생과 관련된 안전사고 발생 시 이에 대한 책임을 지겠습니다.</text:p><text:p>인솔자:　　　　　　　　　　　　(인)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <table:table table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Column"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Column"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Column"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Column"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>’(연속) 5일 이상 교외체험학습(가정학습 포함)시 주 1회 이상 자녀(학생)가 담임 교사와 통화하여 안전, 건강을 확인시키겠습니다.’</text:p><text:p>□ 동의합니다.</text:p><text:p>위반 시 위기학생관리위원회 개최를 요청하고, 군청 관련과 또는 수사기관에 신고할 수 있음을 알려드립니다.</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p>가족동반여행 등 교외체험학습의 경우 미성년자인 자녀의 보호를 위해 보호자 동행함이 원칙임을 안내합니다. 만약 신청 기간 중 발생하는 안전사고는 보호자 책임임을 인지하며, 위 학생의 교외체험학습을 실시하고자 신청합니다.</text:p>
      <text:p>년　 월　 일</text:p>
      <text:p>학생:　　　　　　　　　　　　 인</text:p>
      <text:p>보호자:　　　　　　　　　　　 인</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">범서중학교장　귀하</text:p>

      <text:p text:style-name="PageStart"/>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">「학교장 허가(승인) 교외 체험학습」결과보고서</text:p>
      <table:table table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Column"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Column"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Column"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Column"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>성 명</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>학년 반</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>학년　 반　 번</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>교외체험학습 기간</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>20　 년　 월　 일　~　 월　 일 (　 ) 일간</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>교외체험학습 장소</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>학습 내용</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>○ 현장체험학습(　 )　○ 친·인척 방문(　 )　○ 가족동반여행(　 )　○ 고적답사(　 )</text:p><text:p>○ 향토행사 참여(　 )　○ 기타(　　　　　　)　○ 감염병 심각단계로 인한 가정학습(　 )</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>제　목</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Blue">* 각 일정별 느낀 점, 배운 점 등을 글로 기록하고, 자료, 사진 등으로 학생이 직접 작성합니다. (검은색 볼펜 사용)</text:span></text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Blue">뒷면 혹은 별지에 해당학생 및 인솔자 · 체험장소가 포함된 체험학습 관련사진, 입장권, 항공권 등을 첨부합니다.&gt;</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="LineCell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>첨부: 사진(본인 및 배경 포함)　 장, 입장권　 매, 항공권　 매 등</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>위와 같이 「학교장 허가(승인) 교외 체험학습」 결과보고서를 제출합니다.</text:p><text:p>20　 .　 .　 .</text:p><text:p>보호자 :　　　　　　　　　　　(서명 또는 인)</text:p><text:p>학생 :　　　　　　　　　　　　(서명 또는 인)</text:p><text:p>범서중학교장　귀하</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="Small">※ 보고서 제출 기한: 체험학습 종료 후 7일 이내(휴일 포함)</text:p>

      <text:p text:style-name="PageStart"/>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">「학교장 허가(승인) 교외체험학습」 결과보고서(별지)</text:p>
